{"id":"floem-RUgqPCWfXWMPtMxYLkrtR","title":"Tire Guide","createdAt":1668802019093,"flows":[{"id":"flow-start","flowtext":"<pre><code class=\"language-css\">@font-face {\n  font-family: 'Montserrat';\n  font-style: normal;\n  font-weight: 400;\n  font-display: swap;\n  src: url(https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/montserrat/v25/JTUHjIg1_i6t8kCHKm4532VJOt5-QNFgpCtr6Hw5aXp-p7K4KLg.woff2) format('woff2');\n  unicode-range: U+0000-00FF, U+0131, U+0152-0153, U+02BB-02BC, U+02C6, U+02DA, U+02DC, U+2000-206F, U+2074, U+20AC, U+2122, U+2191, U+2193, U+2212, U+2215, U+FEFF, U+FFFD;\n}\n\n@font-face {\n  font-family: 'Montserrat';\n  font-style: bold;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  font-display: swap;\n  src: url(https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/montserrat/v25/JTUSjIg1_i6t8kCHKm459WlhyyTh89Y.woff2) format('woff2');\n  unicode-range: U+0000-00FF, U+0131, U+0152-0153, U+02BB-02BC, U+02C6, U+02DA, U+02DC, U+2000-206F, U+2074, U+20AC, U+2122, U+2191, U+2193, U+2212, U+2215, U+FEFF, U+FFFD;\n}\n\n@font-face {\n  font-family: 'Archivo Black';\n  font-style: normal;\n  font-weight: 400;\n  font-display: swap;\n  src: url(https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/archivoblack/v17/HTxqL289NzCGg4MzN6KJ7eW6CYyF_jzx13E.woff2) format('woff2');\n  unicode-range: U+0000-00FF, U+0131, U+0152-0153, U+02BB-02BC, U+02C6, U+02DA, U+02DC, U+2000-206F, U+2074, U+20AC, U+2122, U+2191, U+2193, U+2212, U+2215, U+FEFF, U+FFFD;\n}\n\n\n#guide {\n  background-color: rgb(22, 22, 22);\n  font-family: 'Montserrat', arial, sans-serif;\n}\n\nh1,h2,h3 {\n  font-family: 'Archivo Black', arial, sans-serif;\n}\n\nh1 {\n  color: rgb(255, 123, 0);\n  font-size: 33px !important;\n}\n\nh2 {\n  color: rgb(255, 123, 0);\n  font-size: 29px !important;\n}\n\nh3 {\n  font-size: 24px !important;\n}\n\nh4 {\n  font-weight: 400 !important;\n  font-size: 22px !important;\n  color: rgb(247, 247, 247);\n}\n\nh5 {\n  font-weight: 400 !important;\n  font-size: 18px !important;\n  color: rgb(247, 247, 247);\n}\n\np {\n  font-size: 16px !important;\n  color: rgb(164, 164, 164);\n}\n\n.node-case &gt; div {\n  font-size: 22px !important;\n  font-weight: 400 !important;\n  color: #FFF;\n  border-color: #FFF;\n  background-color: rgb(22, 22, 22);\n}\n\n.node-case &gt; .selected {\n  background-color: rgb(255, 123, 0);\n}\n\n.node-case &gt; *:not(.selected):hover {\n  background-color: rgb(255, 123, 0);\n}\n\nimg {\n  max-width: 250px;\n  border-radius: 1rem;\n  margin: 0 !important;\n}\n\n#generations {\n  max-width: 800px;\n  justify-content: center;\n}\n\n#generations img {\n  margin-bottom: 1rem !important;\n}</code></pre><h1>WHICH TIRES DO I NEED?</h1><p>This is the most common question I get. There is no simple answer, and no perfect tire; every option comes with tradeoffs. We built this guide to help you narrow down from thousands of models and sizes to a few solid choices, guaranteed to fit your vehicle, tested and recommended by Prius Offroaders worldwide.</p><p>Our recommendations should be a starting point for your research. Read the product pages, peruse the reviews; <strong>you are responsible for the tires you choose.</strong> If you are all good with that,</p><switch data-switchtype=\"button\" class=\"font-bold flex flex-wrap\"><case data-id=\"case-JXmbM\" class=\"\">Let's get started!</case></switch>","createdAt":1668802019093,"position":{"x":-640.8530971158654,"y":-8374.947658429188}},{"id":"flow-UkkxE","flowtext":"<p>Sorry to hear you're still having trouble. Please send me an email at priusoffroad+rims@gmail.com with a few close-up photos of your wheels so I can help you out!</p>","createdAt":1668814930840,"position":{"x":1064.8650535736474,"y":-338.7587555082371}},{"id":"flow-UMpCn","flowtext":"<pre><code>const maxFuel = maximize == \"Maximum Fuel Economy\"\n\nconst maxRugged = maximize == \"Maximum Ruggedness\"\n\nconst maxDiameter = vehicle.Maximum_Trimmed_Tire_Diameter - (chains == 'Yes' ? 1:0)\n\n// Make this actually connect to button\nconst snowLevels = ['Never', 'Occasionally', 'Frequently', 'Winter']\n\nlet recommendedTires = tires.filter(tire =&gt; {\n  if (snowLevels.indexOf(snow) &gt;  snowLevels.indexOf(tire.Snow_Level))\n    return false\n\n  if (tire.Snow_Level == 'Winter' &amp;&amp; snow != 'Frequently')\n    return false\n  \n  switch (maximize) {\n    case ('Maximum Ruggedness'):\n      return tire.Ruggedness == 3 || tire.Ruggedness == 4\n      break\n    case ('Maximum Fuel Economy'):\n      return tire.Ruggedness == 1 || tire.Ruggedness == 2\n      break\n    default:\n      return tire.Ruggedness == 2 || tire.Ruggedness == 3\n      break\n  }\n\n  return true\n}).map(v =&gt; Object.assign({}, v))\n\nconst formula = `AND({Diameter}&gt;=${vehicle.Standard_Diameter},{Diameter}&lt;=${maxDiameter},{Rim}=${rimSize.replaceAll('\"','')})`\n\nconst sizes = (await (await fetch(`https://api.airtable.com/v0/appnqPFee60PlXjcg/Sizes?filterByFormula=${formula}`, \n    {\n      method: 'GET',\n      headers: {\n        Accept: 'application/json',\n      'Content-Type': 'application/json',\n        Authorization: `Bearer keyQviYovwIMo11IU`,\n      },\n    }\n  )).json()).records\n  console.log('SIZES!', sizes)\n\nfor (let tire of recommendedTires) {\n  tire.Sizes = tire.Sizes.filter(v =&gt; sizes.find(b =&gt; b.id == v))\n  tire.Sizes = tire.Sizes.map(v =&gt; sizes.find(b =&gt; b.id == v).fields)\n}\n\nrecommendedTires = recommendedTires.filter(v =&gt; v.Sizes.length &gt; 0)\n\nfunction trunc(n, p=1) {\n  return  Math.round(\n    n*Math.pow(10, p)\n  ) / Math.pow(10, p)\n}\n\nconst recommendationBlurb = `${maxFuel?` Since fuel economy is your priority, we've chosen a size closer to your vehicle's standard tires.` : maxRugged?` Since ruggedness is your priority, we've chosen a large size to maximize your ground clearance.`:` We've chosen an intermediate size to balance fuel economy and ground clearance.`}`\n\nconst tireCount = recommendedTires.length\nlet tire\nlet tireSize\nlet tireSizes\nlet allowedSizes\nlet recommendedSize\nlet blurb\nlet raisedHeight\nlet baseHeight = trunc(vehicle.Base_Height)\nlet truncDiameter\nlet requiresTrimming\nlet winter\nlet tagString = ''\nlet tags = ''\nlet ruggednessBlurb = ''\nlet testUrl = 'https://polytrope.com'</code></pre><switch data-switchtype=\"condition\" class=\"font-bold flex flex-wrap\"><case data-id=\"case-3YPxX\" class=\"\">recommendedTires.length == 0</case><case data-id=\"case-bpgjB\" class=\"\">recommendedTires.length == 1</case></switch>","createdAt":1668814933180,"position":{"x":208.03502450119498,"y":515.9299479343149}},{"id":"flow-44ywg","flowtext":"<p><div target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://google.com\">https://google.com</div> </p>","createdAt":1668814934681,"position":{"x":-1489.9698665564656,"y":2584.84593659053}},{"id":"flow-fzdXq","flowtext":"<h4>Do you expect to use these tires in snow?</h4><p>This is a major factor in choosing a tire. If you're driving in winter conditions, we'll make sure to only recommend tires that are up to the job.</p><switch data-switchtype=\"button\" class=\"font-bold flex flex-wrap\"><assignee class=\"\">snow</assignee><case data-id=\"case-B9Xkg\" class=\"\">Frequently</case><case data-id=\"case-86x4p\" class=\"\">Occasionally</case><case data-id=\"case-3KnNc\" class=\"\">Never</case></switch><pre><code>const neverSnowBlurb = snow == 'Never' ? ' Since you never expect to drive in snow, this may not be relevant to you.' : ''</code></pre><h4>Do you want to ensure that tire chains or cables will fit?</h4><p>Traction devices like tire chains or cables require a little extra space in the wheel well to install, so we factor that into our size recommendation.{neverSnowBlurb}</p><switch data-switchtype=\"button\" class=\"font-bold flex flex-wrap\"><assignee class=\"\">chains</assignee><case data-id=\"case-A6wdB\" class=\"\">Yes</case><case data-id=\"case-AQQNz\" class=\"\">No</case></switch><h4>Are you trying to <em>absolute</em>ly <em>maximize </em>either fuel economy or ruggedness?</h4><p>Put simply, there is a fundamental tradeoff between these considerations. Offroad tires tend to be noisier and might cost you a few MPG. [Low-rolling-resistance](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Low_rolling_resistance_tire) tires are great on the highway, but struggle in rough conditions. Bigger tires provide ground clearance, smaller tires preserve mileage. We usually recommend something in-between.</p><switch data-switchtype=\"button\" class=\"font-bold flex flex-wrap\"><assignee class=\"\">maximize</assignee><case data-id=\"case-NT4UK\" class=\"\">Maximum Fuel Economy</case><case data-id=\"case-zQgf3\" class=\"\">Maximum Ruggedness</case><case data-id=\"case-JjeYx\" class=\"\">No Strict Preference</case></switch>","createdAt":1668815154146,"position":{"x":-137.46661932535145,"y":-1117.0089993552401}},{"id":"flow-Q7rYQ","flowtext":"<h2>AltiMAX RT43</h2><h3>Size: 205/70 R15</h3><p>This tire rules</p><p><img src=\"https://fvdevhpbooirqodnxcyc.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/blobs/9c59002cdad656222e0031342fd68461484575de40f9d537085d3af600d72fec\"></p>","createdAt":1668825768730,"position":{"x":2990.6217837621994,"y":1949.6880011158364}},{"id":"flow-nhHxp","flowtext":"<h2>GEOLANDAR A/T G015</h2><h3>Size: 205/70 R15</h3><p>This tire rules</p><p><img src=\"https://fvdevhpbooirqodnxcyc.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/blobs/4736124463e8eb6d53f680adbe2af6d2c46db0367df5f9f15b4037be4d0a7273\"></p>","createdAt":1668825772318,"position":{"x":1441.1506580680325,"y":1696.4456984763215}},{"id":"flow-djBGe","flowtext":"<h2>Michelin CrossClimate 2</h2><h3>Size: 205/70 R15</h3><p><img src=\"https://static.tirerack.com/content/dam/tires/michelin/mi_crossclimate_2_full.jpg?imwidth=440&amp;impolicy=tow-pdp-main\"></p>","createdAt":1668825781033,"position":{"x":2203.7339837159416,"y":1835.2651054332882}},{"id":"flow-NP4rd","flowtext":"<p></p><p>Most Priuses come with 15\" rims, but Toyota also offers a larger and more expensive set of 17\" rims. It is very unlikely that you have 16\" rims, unless you or a previous owner purchased a completely new set of aftermarket wheels.</p><p>If for some reason you are unable to identify the size from your tires, use a measuring tape to measure the diameter of your hubcaps.</p><p>Change your answer above once you have identified your rim size.</p><switch data-switchtype=\"button\" class=\"font-bold flex flex-wrap\"><case data-id=\"case-8zCWc\" class=\"\">Still Unsure</case><case data-id=\"case-fMHg3\" class=\"\">It's Something Else</case></switch>","createdAt":1668827045923,"position":{"x":609.6320579533468,"y":-1086.788055158806}},{"id":"flow-nCCUM","flowtext":"<pre><code>function trunc(n, p=1) {\n  return  Math.round(\n    n*Math.pow(10, p)\n  ) / Math.pow(10, p)\n}\n\nfunction clearance(size) {\n  return vehicle.Base_Ground_Clearance+(size.Diameter-vehicle.Standard_Diameter)/2+1.5\n}\n\ntire = recommendedTires.pop()\n\ntire.Sizes.sort((a, b) =&gt; a.Diameter-b.Diameter)\n\ntire.Sizes = tire.Sizes.filter(v =&gt; v.Diameter &gt;= vehicle.Standard_Diameter)\n\nwinter = tire.Snow_Level === 'Winter'\nconsole.log('SNOW!', snow, tire.Snow_Level, winter, tire.Snow_Level === 'Winter')\n\n// Picks the largest tire\nif (maxRugged)\n  recommendedSize = tire.Sizes.reduce((a, b) =&gt; (b.Diameter &gt; a.Diameter &amp;&amp; b.Diameter &lt; vehicle.Maximum_Tire_Diameter) ? b : a)\n// Picks the tire closest to the standard size for this vehicle\nelse if (maxFuel)\n  recommendedSize = tire.Sizes.reduce((a, b) =&gt;\n  Math.abs(a.Diameter-vehicle.Standard_Diameter) &lt;\n  Math.abs(b.Diameter-vehicle.Standard_Diameter) ?\n  a : b)\n// Picks a tire halfway between the standard and maximum tire sizes\nelse\n  recommendedSize = tire.Sizes.reduce((a, b) =&gt;\n  Math.abs(a.Diameter-(vehicle.Standard_Diameter+vehicle.Maximum_Tire_Diameter)/2) &lt;\n  Math.abs(b.Diameter-(vehicle.Standard_Diameter+vehicle.Maximum_Tire_Diameter)/2) ?\n  a : b)\n  \n\ntruncDiameter = trunc(recommendedSize.Diameter)\nfinalHeight = trunc(clearance(recommendedSize))\nrequiresTrimming = recommendedSize.Diameter &gt; vehicle.Maximum_Tire_Diameter\n\n// Constructs a list of all possible tire sizes\ntireSizes = '&lt;b&gt;All Fitting Sizes:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;'+tire.Sizes.map(v =&gt; `${recommendedSize == v ? '&lt;b&gt;':''}&lt;a href=${v.Tire_Rack_URL}&gt;${v.Key}&lt;/a&gt; — ${trunc(v.Diameter)}\" diameter, ${trunc(clearance(v))}\" clearance${v.Diameter &lt; vehicle.Maximum_Tire_Diameter ? '':' — &lt;i&gt;May Require Trimming! &lt;/i&gt;'}${recommendedSize == v ? '&lt;/b&gt;':''}`).join('&lt;br&gt;')\n\n//tagString = ' '+tire.Tags.map(v =&gt; v.slice(0, 3)).join('')\ntagString = winter ? '  ❄️':''\ntags = tire.Tags.map(v =&gt; '  '+v).join('&lt;br&gt;')\n\nswitch (tire.Ruggedness) {\n  case 1:\n    ruggednessBlurb = ' This tire offers the absolute maximum MPG, but at the expense of durability and tread life.'\n    break\n  case 2:\n    ruggednessBlurb = ' This all-around tire offers balanced performance across a range of highway conditions.'\n    break\n  case 3:\n    ruggednessBlurb = ' This tire is more rugged than your standard touring tire, without giving up its highway manners.'\n    break\n  case 4:\n    ruggednessBlurb = ' This extra-rugged tire excels off-road, but at the expense of noise and fuel economy.'\n    break\n}\n\n// Constructs a blurb about why this tire\nblurb = `Combined with our lift kit, this tire brings your vehicle from ${vehicle.Base_Ground_Clearance}\" up to &lt;b&gt;${finalHeight}\" of ground clearance!&lt;/b&gt;${ruggednessBlurb}${winter?' Please note that &lt;b&gt;this is a winter tire,&lt;/b&gt; it should only be used in &lt;b&gt;temperatures below 45°&lt;/b&gt;.':''}${requiresTrimming ? ' However, even the smallest size of this tire &lt;b&gt;may rub against your vehicle&lt;/b&gt; unless you trim some plastic from the inside of your wheel well.':''}`</code></pre><div row=\"true\" id=\"\" class=\"group basis-64 grow flex row flex-wrap\"><div row=\"false\" id=\"\" class=\"group basis-64 grow column\"><h2>{tire.Key}{tagString}</h2><h4>[Recommended Size: {recommendedSize.Key}]({recommendedSize.Tire_Rack_URL})</h4><h5><strong>Ruggedness: {tire.Ruggedness}/4</strong></h5><h5>{tags}</h5><p>{blurb}</p><p><strong>From the manufacturer:</strong><br>\"{tire.Description}\"</p><p>{tireSizes}</p></div><p><img class=\"min-w-[100px] min-h-[100px]\" src=\"{tire.Image}\" alt=\"\"></p></div><switch data-switchtype=\"condition\" class=\"font-bold flex flex-wrap\"><case data-id=\"case-RM7qQ\" class=\"\">recommendedTires.length &gt; 0</case></switch>","createdAt":1668827541695,"position":{"x":-4.97924891761329,"y":4200.399185238205}},{"id":"flow-4WWmU","flowtext":"<p></p><switch data-switchtype=\"condition\" class=\"font-bold flex\"><case data-id=\"case-mggNN\" class=\"\">map(recommendedTires)</case></switch>","createdAt":1668827822154,"position":{"x":-1672.1246774586052,"y":2185.637843783826}},{"id":"flow-CHLKc","flowtext":"<ul class=\"not-prose\" data-type=\"taskList\"><li data-checked=\"true\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\" checked=\"checked\"><span></span></label><div><p> dddd</p><ul class=\"not-prose\" data-type=\"taskList\"><li data-checked=\"true\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\" checked=\"checked\"><span></span></label><div><p>dddd</p></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p>dddd</p></div></li></ul></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p>dddfa</p></div></li></ul><p></p><p>ddd</p>","createdAt":1668829309699,"position":{"x":-1176.778675246877,"y":2120.6424520618743}},{"id":"flow-mtjTN","flowtext":"<h4>These tires are just a recommendation, but each of them are guaranteed to work with our lift kits.<br><br>Beware that large tires may rub against the plastic in your wheel well and require some trimming to fit!</h4><p><br><em>If you see a problem with this guide or have any other feedback, I would like to know! Send me an email at priusoffroad+tireguide@gmail.com</em></p>","createdAt":1668830178465,"position":{"x":44.340622425771016,"y":7372.859988226627}},{"id":"flow-HptdD","flowtext":"<p><strong>Maximizing fuel economy comes at the expense of ground clearance and performance in adverse conditions like dirt, mud, rain, or snow. These tires are best for commuters!</strong></p>","createdAt":1668832713604,"position":{"x":-449.7190721697125,"y":220.24363261180335}},{"id":"flow-RRq7H","flowtext":"<p><strong>Maximizing ruggedness can come at the expense of fuel economy, noise, and tire life. These tires are best for adventurers!</strong></p>","createdAt":1668835399486,"position":{"x":609.679241630482,"y":150.9356365000661}},{"id":"flow-MGcAW","flowtext":"<p>Thanks! I will try to get back to you within 2 business days.</p>","createdAt":1668836929264,"position":{"x":2473.7768766354748,"y":-1538.6799740588324}},{"id":"flow-X4Etc","flowtext":"<pre><code>const vehicles = (await (await fetch(`https://api.airtable.com/v0/appnqPFee60PlXjcg/Vehicles`, \n  {\n    method: 'GET',\n    headers: {\n      Accept: 'application/json',\n      'Content-Type': 'application/json',\n      Authorization: `Bearer keyQviYovwIMo11IU`,\n    },\n  }\n)).json()).records.map(v =&gt; v.fields)\nconsole.log('VEHICLES!', vehicles)\n\nlet vehicle\nif (priusGeneration != 'Something Else') {\n  vehicle = vehicles.find(v =&gt; v.Key.startsWith(priusGeneration))\n}\nelse {\n  vehicle = vehicles.find(v =&gt; v.Key == otherVehicle)\n}\nconsole.log('VEHICLE!', vehicle)</code></pre><h4>What size are your rims?</h4><p>Look for the size printed on the side of your tire, something like 195/60R15. The number after the R on your tire is the diameter of your rims in inches.</p><switch data-switchtype=\"button\" class=\"font-bold flex flex-wrap\"><assignee class=\"\">rimSize</assignee><case data-id=\"case-bd7mD\" class=\"\">15\"</case><case data-id=\"case-EMe6W\" class=\"\">16\"</case><case data-id=\"case-B6EHD\" class=\"\">17\"</case><case data-id=\"case-Hwx6y\" class=\"\">I don't know</case></switch>","createdAt":1668837785236,"position":{"x":81.19326738945972,"y":-2296.4801511351498}},{"id":"flow-qiKTB","flowtext":"<pre><code>const tires = (await (await fetch(`https://api.airtable.com/v0/appnqPFee60PlXjcg/Tires`, \n  {\n    method: 'GET',\n    headers: {\n      Accept: 'application/json',\n      'Content-Type': 'application/json',\n      Authorization: `Bearer keyQviYovwIMo11IU`,\n    },\n  }\n)).json()).records.map(v =&gt; v.fields)\n\nfor (const tire of tires) {\n  if (tire.Image)\n    tire.Image = tire.Image[0].url\n}\n\nconsole.log('TIRES!', tires)</code></pre><h4>Which generation is your Prius?</h4><p>If you don't know this off the top of your head, try comparing the dashboard and exterior to the images below.</p><div row=\"true\" id=\"generations\" class=\"group basis-64 grow flex row flex-wrap\"><h5>Generation II ('04–09)<br><img class=\"min-w-[100px] min-h-[100px]\" src=\"https://fvdevhpbooirqodnxcyc.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/blobs/d0defdabb39bd0032d01c0ac39d72a2db68618135dd8a3b6a26c70d689b37965\"></h5><h5>Generation III ('10–15)<br><img class=\"min-w-[100px] min-h-[100px]\" src=\"https://fvdevhpbooirqodnxcyc.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/blobs/28fc8f87dccf4f4c46c2822771e3a0a8be8a2c41ed4dedbc1c073f0a06041f3e\"></h5><h5>Generation IV ('16–22)<br><img class=\"min-w-[100px] min-h-[100px]\" src=\"https://fvdevhpbooirqodnxcyc.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/blobs/c9a2189fa072bd07884d443a1adbfc2023ab3570decbec450777ec7bde7aa9db\"></h5><h5>Prius V ('12–17)<br><img class=\"min-w-[100px] min-h-[100px]\" src=\"https://fvdevhpbooirqodnxcyc.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/blobs/33419a22e57b3a8069595e219fa8b4eff0fbf303243ed26677786cfe21ea958b\"></h5><h5>Prius C ('12–19)<br><img class=\"min-w-[100px] min-h-[100px]\" src=\"https://fvdevhpbooirqodnxcyc.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/blobs/01a56c9a03b283c6eef9bd67e6c6d839a12e24892d34ec7d57d01d4977201a03\"></h5></div><switch data-switchtype=\"button\" class=\"font-bold flex flex-wrap\"><assignee class=\"\">priusGeneration</assignee><case data-id=\"case-fn3Xa\" class=\"\">Gen II</case><case data-id=\"case-H7fAj\" class=\"\">Gen III</case><case data-id=\"case-HwhAN\" class=\"\">Gen IV</case><case data-id=\"case-FqHBU\" class=\"\">Prius V</case><case data-id=\"case-XzRn6\" class=\"\">Prius C</case><case data-id=\"case-H7WQ7\" class=\"\">Something Else</case></switch>","createdAt":1669948326225,"position":{"x":-416.0062921755143,"y":-4333.984241231774}},{"id":"flow-akbff","flowtext":"<pre><code>tireSize = tireSizes.pop()</code></pre><p>{tireSize.Key}</p><switch data-switchtype=\"condition\" class=\"font-bold flex\"><case data-id=\"case-y9Cyy\" class=\"\">tireSizes.length &gt; 0</case></switch>","createdAt":1670012376851,"position":{"x":1665.869414430733,"y":2896.9560848888814}},{"id":"flow-LTqDE","flowtext":"<switch data-switchtype=\"condition\" class=\"font-bold flex\"><case data-id=\"case-ULKnx\" class=\"\"></case></switch>","createdAt":1670012401259,"position":{"x":2029.819495005524,"y":3460.62806065331}},{"id":"flow-prptw","flowtext":"<h4>Which vehicle do you need tires for?</h4><switch data-switchtype=\"button\" class=\"font-bold flex\"><assignee class=\"\">vehicleCategory</assignee><case data-id=\"case-btWwA\" class=\"\">Prius</case><case data-id=\"case-BGjGy\" class=\"\">Corolla</case><case data-id=\"case-Yd8PN\" class=\"\">Lexus CT200h</case></switch>","createdAt":1670027299404,"position":{"x":-1072.3091517498683,"y":-2157.269362827591}},{"id":"flow-4mP4e","flowtext":"<h4>Is it one of these?</h4><p>If not, I'm afraid we can't advise.</p><switch data-switchtype=\"button\" class=\"font-bold flex flex-wrap\"><assignee class=\"\">otherVehicle</assignee><case data-id=\"case-PkqYE\" class=\"\">Corolla '09–18</case><case data-id=\"case-QitGM\" class=\"\">Corolla '19–22</case><case data-id=\"case-3cTka\" class=\"\">Yaris '07–14</case><case d